WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.600
Bring workers' comp billing into your product.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.220
MindBill connects the workflow from the first submission to

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.240
the final payment.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.540
Start with a sandbox and a server side API

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.160
key.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.040
Bring the case data and documents you already have.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.080
California medical legal billing is available today.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.760
Send one reviewed bill and its supporting documents.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.580
MindBill validates the packet, routes the submission, and returns

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.320
one bill ID to track.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.780
Build your own interface or embed a connected billing

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:38.400
workspace.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.500
Give users bill tasks, reports, and the full life

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.640
cycle right inside your application.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.540
Keep your product in sync with signed webhooks and

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.720
life cycle events.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:55.420
Follow acknowledgments, review payment details, and respond when a

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.600
bill needs attention.

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.160
Test the full flow in the sandbox where submissions

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:08.860
never reach payers, then connect your approved live organization

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.840
and move the integration into production.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:17.240
Your product, one connected billing workflow.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.920
Start building with MindBill.
